      "content": "Thanks. One concern we have is about the \"hidden\" data. Sometimes when we run deletion scripts, there are residual bits in logs or old temp files that don't seem to get wiped properly. How do we ensure there aren't any \"pockets\" of data left behind that might fail an audit?",
